#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Distributed Node Engine
#  File: distributed_node_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS distributed node engine responsible for:
#      • cluster membership
#      • distributed messaging
#      • heartbeat monitoring
#      • replication hooks
#      • distributed telemetry
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Cluster Membership](ca://s?q=Explain_Cluster_Membership)
#    - [Distributed Messaging](ca://s?q=Explain_Distributed_Messaging)
#    - [Heartbeat System](ca://s?q=Explain_Heartbeat_System)
#    - [Replication Hooks](ca://s?q=Explain_Replication_Hooks)
#    - [Distributed Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_Distributed_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - join_cluster(address)
#         Adds node to cluster.
#
#    - leave_cluster(node_id)
#         Removes node.
#
#    - register_handler(name, handler)
#         Registers distributed message handler.
#
#    - send(node_id, handler, payload)
#         Sends message to node.
#
#    - broadcast(handler, payload)
#         Sends message to all nodes.
#
#    - heartbeat(node_id)
#         Updates heartbeat timestamp.
#
#    - heartbeat_loop()
#         Sends periodic heartbeats.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns distributed engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  NODE STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "ND-XXXX",
#      "address": "10.0.0.5",
#      "joined": <epoch>,
#      "last_heartbeat": <epoch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
#  RELATED MODULES:
